  <title>Ikasteko modua</title>
  <p>
    In Learn Mode, <app>Orca</app> will announce each keystroke you pressed
    along with any associated <app>Orca</app> command that keystroke is bound
    to. In this mode, you can also get a list of shortcuts containing all the
    <app>Orca</app> commands you can use.
  </p>
  <steps>
    <title>Ikasteko modua erabiltzea</title>
    <item>
      <p>Ikasteko modura joateko, sakatu <keyseq><key>Orca aldatzailea</key> <key>H</key></keyseq>.</p>
    </item>
    <item>
      <p>Sakatu edozein tekla edo tekla-konbinazio. <app>Orcak</app> tekla horiek eta haiei lotutako komandoak esango ditu.</p>
    </item>
    <item>
      <p>Sakatu <key>Esc</key> ikasteko modutik irteteko.</p>
    </item>
  </steps>
  <steps>
    <title>Lasterbideen zerrenda bat eskuratzea</title>
    <item>
      <p>Ikasteko modura joateko, sakatu <keyseq><key>Orca aldatzailea</key> <key>H</key></keyseq>.</p>
    </item>
    <item>
      <p>
        Press <key>F2</key> if you want a list of shortcuts that apply
        <app>Orca</app>-wide, or press <key>F3</key> if you want a list
        of shortcuts that are specifically for the application with focus.
      </p>
    </item>
    <item>
      <p>Sakatu <key>Up</key> edo <key>Down</key> zerrendaren edukiak aztertzeko.</p>
    </item>
    <item>
      <p>Sakatu <key>Esc</key> zerrendatik irteteko.</p>
    </item>
  </steps>
